  "body": "Changing/adding metadata (much) later can be done with or without changing the date of the files. (I vaguely remember vivid discussions about this.)\n\nThe first approach makes the editing date unclear, while the second can create problems for backup programs. With a timestamp, there should be no need to worry about the file dates.\n\nThis is clearly not an issue, just a humble suggestion.",
